<title>PORTUGAL: Av price in Portugal floater auction 9,989.25 esc.</title>
<headline>Av price in Portugal floater auction 9,989.25 esc.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The results of the following issue were announced by Portugal's Public Credit Committee. The average weighted price rose to 9,989.25 escudos, compared with 9,962.6 at the previous auction.</p>
<p>Entity: Republic of Portugal</p>
<p>Amount placed: 10 billion escudos</p>
<p>Indexed to 6-mth Lisbor minus 25 bp</p>
<p>Maturity:15/Aug/03     Denom:10</p>
<p>Pay Date:23/Dec/96     Payment of coupon: six months</p>
<p>Average weighted price: 9,989.25</p>
<p>Maximum price: 9,990</p>
<p>Minimum price: 9,988.50</p>
<p>Demand: 68.25 bln esc</p>
<p>Estimate of total issued: 221.667 bln esc</p>
<p>S&amp;P: AAA</p>
<p>Issue fungible with OTRV/1996/2003</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
